# A deliberately malformed slice manifest: it carries NO `a gmeow:Slice` triple,
# so SliceCatalog::discover must hard-fail (SliceError::InvalidManifest) rather
# than return a vacuous, empty catalog.

@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/malformed>
    rdfs:label "not actually a slice" .
